---
import art from '../assets/jester-hero.svg';
---
<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <div class="hero-copy">
    <p class="eyebrow hero-eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-symbol" aria-hidden="true">✧</span> The art of the unwise · Vol. I</p>
    <h1 id="hero-title">Long live <em>the fool.</em></h1>
    <p class="lede">One hundred irreverent reflections on humor, rebellion, and the strangely wise art of playing the jester.</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a class="btn" href="#explore">Explore all 100 quotes <span aria-hidden="true">↘</span></a>
      <button class="btn secondary" id="surprise-me" type="button">Surprise me <span aria-hidden="true">✧</span></button>
    </div>
    <p class="hero-note">A collection for curious minds and inconvenient truths</p>
  </div>
  <figure class="hero-visual">
    <div class="hero-frame">
      <img class="hero-art" src={art.src} alt="A half-masked jester in a velvet cap, framed like an antique playing card" width="880" height="740" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" />
    </div>
    <figcaption class="hero-art-caption"><span>Fig. 01 / The Jester</span><span>Not all fools wear crowns</span></figcaption>
  </figure>
</section>
